SkinType: Android takes the macOS branch, with the skin faces loaded by family from the module's resources and iOS's default text-style sizes in place of AppKit's font queries.

diff --git a/Piru/Views/Components/SkinType.swift b/Piru/Views/Components/SkinType.swift
